OL,3,GNEWSAHolyrood committee conveners set
OL,4,Afor #15,000 pay rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FMSPs who chair committees at Holyrood
OL,7,Fare to receive a #15,000 pay rise.
OL,9,FPresiding Officer Kenneth Gibson said
OL,10,Fcommittees were "at the heart" of
OL,11,Fholding the government to account, and
OL,12,Fthat convening them came with
OL,13,Fsignificant extra demands.
OL,15,FStarting from next April they are to be
OL,16,Fgiven an extra payment equivalent to
OL,17,F20% of an MSP's annual salary of
OL,18,F#77,000.
OL,20,FThe proposal will be subject to a vote,
OL,21,Fbecause the parliament's salary scheme
OL,22,Fwill need to be amended.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
